{"_meta":{"opentrain.ai/authoring-retry":{"allowedRetryAction":"Inspect the same folder/page/asset. Finalize is convergent: repeat it for the same asset after the PUT completed; a READY asset returns the same result. Never allocate a replacement after an uncertain outcome.","automaticRetry":false,"identityFields":["folderId","pageId","assetId"],"inspect":[{"method":"GET","path":"/api/public/v1/instructions/folders/{folderId}/assets/{assetId}"}],"keyRequirement":"NO_CLIENT_KEY","missingResourceBehavior":"UNKNOWN_NOT_SUCCESS","policy":"ASSET_IDENTITY_INSPECTION","schemaVersion":"folder-instruction-authoring-retry/1","staleStateBehavior":"READY is immutable and cannot be canceled. A missing row/404 or uncertain provider result requires reconciliation, not success.","stateActions":{"CANCELED":"CANONICAL_CANCELLATION_RESPONSE_ONLY","CANCELING":"POLL_THEN_RECONCILE_SAME_ASSET","NOT_FOUND":"UNKNOWN_NOT_SUCCESS","PENDING":"EXPLICIT_SAME_ASSET_CANCEL_ALLOWED","PROCESSING":"EXPLICIT_SAME_ASSET_CANCEL_ALLOWED","READY":"IMMUTABLE_CONFLICT","UNKNOWN":"RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED"}}},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"After the PUT completed: the server sniffs the stored bytes against the declared type, bounds the size and marks the asset READY, returning the delivery url and the node to insert. Convergent \u2014 an already-READY asset returns the same; an expired PENDING upload fails (prepare again). Requires current employer folder access. Empty destinations require reviewed activation; published/unknown delivery writes refuse without changing release/read/ack flags. Requires instructions:write.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"assetId":{"$ref":"#/properties/folderId"},"confirmed":{"const":true,"type":"boolean"},"folderId":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]{1,128}$","type":"string"}},"re